window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>My life is no longer my own. Now, it belongs to them….</b></p> <p>I had a stalker. Three of them, actually.</p> <p>They'd been watching me from the shadows for years. And when the time was right, they seduced me with lies. Lured me into thinking they were good men.</p> <p>They aren't.</p> <p>Good men wouldn't have blackmailed me into being their captive. But they have, and they'll do anything to get revenge against my family, even if it destroys me.</p> <p>What they don't realize is that I know the truth.</p> <p>They're obsessed with me. Want to claim me. Own me—body and soul.</p> <p>Most of all, I see them.</p> <p>Damien's cruelty, Rome's anger, the pain behind Liam's scars…they call to me. Make me want things they can never give me.</p> <p>Like their hearts.</p> <p>I know our time together will soon end. I should be scared of what will happen to me once their revenge is complete. But truthfully?</p> <p>The only thing that scares me is how willing I am to give these men everything they want…</p>"; 
